# HAT TRICK, 4-10: the Captain, a big prop with the armband, walks and jumps
# about the whole stadium after you, throwing two rugby balls at a time. The
# demo player beats him.
game hattrick
wait 5
cheat level 40
cheat skipintro
cheat god
expect foes_16 == 1
expect hp_16 == 20
waituntil shots_3 >= 2 200
cheat mortal
cheat spare 0 99
botuntil foes == 0 9000
expect falling == 5
